		(uuid "f34afbe9-b5cb-5689-b3f5-4844c0bb3ae6")
	)
	(text "High beam, turn signals and illumination are active at +12 V: 4.7 kΩ and the EL817 LED to ground,\n10 kΩ to ground so an open wire reads off. Neutral is active to ground: the gearbox switch grounds\nthe wire, so the LED is fed from +12V_P. Outputs are active low, with the Pico's internal pull-ups."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 20.828 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5955a55e-178b-5036-a6a6-97d235b5b492")
	)
	(text "Neutral (active to ground)  →  GP6"
